  "description": "Coject Email Provider is a powerful and flexible C# class library designed to simplify the integration of email communication capabilities into your applications. It supports multiple email providers, ensuring seamless compatibility with a variety of email services.\n    Key Features:\n    Multi-Provider Support: Effortlessly integrate with and switch between different email providers to meet diverse application requirements.\n    Email Sending: Send plain text and HTML emails with attachments through an intuitive API.\n    Incoming Email Handling: Manage and process incoming emails using IMAP or POP3 protocols, enabling robust email-driven workflows.\n    Rich Email Formatting: Support for customizable templates, inline images, and rich media to create engaging email content.\n    User-Friendly API: Built with developers in mind, making email functionality integration quick and straightforward.\n    Extensible Architecture: Easily extend or customize to support additional providers or tailor features to unique application needs.\n    Whether you're creating a customer notification system, a marketing platform, or an enterprise-grade email service, Coject Email Provider provides the tools you need for reliable, scalable email integration.",
